{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/85dbb8edeb219d84507aaf569ac8107f.avif?t=1773045336\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras_big/85dbb8edeb219d84507aaf569ac8107f.avif?t=1773045336 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mecha Force, developed by the groundbreaking Ming Studio, redefines mech games by blending immersive 3D cockpit gameplay with modern Roguelite elements. This first-person mech action game channels the passion for classic Japanese mecha anime into an unprecedented combat experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Confront Terror in a Chaotic Future</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity's first contact with extraterrestrial life - the &quot;Dominators&quot; - ended in catastrophe. After brief communication attempts, the invaders launched a full-scale assault. Overwhelming technological disparity left mankind virtually defenseless. Now, you must pilot humanity's last hope - the mech &quot;Kylin&quot; - rallying all surviving forces to protect Earth's lifeforms and launch a counteroffensive against the alien invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/7ffe8c47592d4d8bf7e4c867f616f63c.poster.avif?t=1773045336\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/7ffe8c47592d4d8bf7e4c867f616f63c.webm?t=1773045336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/7ffe8c47592d4d8bf7e4c867f616f63c.mp4?t=1773045336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Command Your Mech to Resist Invasion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the cockpit, synchronize with the &quot;Kylin&quot;, and drive the giant mech into battle against mechanized enemies of varying forms. Experience pure mecha aesthetics through immersive combat encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/10ed56517159328725ee8c2c50cf196a.poster.avif?t=1773045336\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/10ed56517159328725ee8c2c50cf196a.webm?t=1773045336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/10ed56517159328725ee8c2c50cf196a.mp4?t=1773045336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize and Upgrade Your Mech</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each sortie, you'll discover new weapon types, abundant upgrade options, diverse combat environments, and mysterious unknown powers that recreate those deja vu moments of brilliance in gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/c79a8e9504faf0d385a3c054381628b9.poster.avif?t=1773045336\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/c79a8e9504faf0d385a3c054381628b9.webm?t=1773045336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/c79a8e9504faf0d385a3c054381628b9.mp4?t=1773045336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guided by the Enigmatic &quot;Maki&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Machineera&quot; connects with the &quot;Kylin&quot; through Neural Link as your navigator. This mysterious girl will fight alongside you, helping reclaim humanity's future with every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/93465073806b4ac2c941c20df6267e4e.poster.avif?t=1773045336\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/93465073806b4ac2c941c20df6267e4e.webm?t=1773045336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/93465073806b4ac2c941c20df6267e4e.mp4?t=1773045336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4036130?t=1773045336","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/35d9e59fe88b7858a63a2811400107bf5cf4bf99/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773045336","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/3de4c24510cb3e9ff6d48126a4d0066af5da84f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773045336","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/3de4c24510cb3e9ff6d48126a4d0066af5da84f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773045336","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4264910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras/85dbb8edeb219d84507aaf569ac8107f.avif?t=1773045336\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036130/extras_big/85dbb8edeb219d84507aaf569ac8